msgstr "romp: "

#: script/room.js:296
msgid "hungry mouths crave meat. beasts attack wanderers in the wild. wanderers want to strike back. builder says villagers could help hunt, given the means with a hunting lodge."
msgstr "hongerige monden verlangen naar vlees. beesten vallen zwervers aan in de wildernis. zwervers willen terugslaan. de bouwster zegt dat dorpelingen kunnen helpen jagen, als ze de middelen hebben met een jachthut."

#: script/events/outside.js:492
msgid "hunt the pack down"
msgstr "de roedel opsporen"

#: script/localization.js:28
#: script/outside.js:22
msgid "hunter"
msgstr "jager"

#: script/room.js:106
#: script/room.js:145
msgid "hut"
msgstr "hut"

#: script/engine.js:1080
#: script/engine.js:1092
#: script/engine.js:219
